 "name_en": "Profit Center Valuation (6VQ)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Profit Center Valuation (6VQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <div class=\"p\">\n       <div class=\"note note note_note\">\n        <span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span>\n        <p class=\"p\">You can only use this function if you have activated the business function <span class=\"ph uicontrol\">Universal Parallel Accounting</span> (<span class=\"ph sap-technical-name\">FINS_PARALLEL_ACCOUNTING_BF</span>).</p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Ledger-specific valuation to reflect transfer prices between profit centers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Internal goods movements treated differently from trading outside the group</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Elimination of intercompany profits where profit centers are in different company codes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Provides management with a view of costs and profits at the subgroup level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Supports divisional reporting with agreed-upon transfer prices between profit centers</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>利润中心评估 (6VQ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <div class=\"p\">\n       <div class=\"note note note_note\">\n        <span class=\"note__title\">注释：</span>\n<p class=\"p\">仅当已激活业务功能<span class=\"ph uicontrol\">统一并行会计核算</span> (<span class=\"ph sap-technical-name\">FINS_PARALLEL_ACCOUNTING_BF</span>) 时，才能使用此功能。</p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">反映利润中心之间转移价格的分类账特定评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">内部货物移动的处理方式不同于集团外的交易。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">抵销利润中心位于不同公司代码的公司间利润。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc4d7acffaf514a8ebb497d17b8bb732b__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为管理层提供子组级别的成本和利润视图。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持部门报告，其中包含利润中心之间商定的转让价格</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
